38
00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.460
Kuri

39
00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:31.039
kolme jalaga asi ja.

40
00:02:31.139 --> 00:02:33.660
Teravad hambad suus.

41
00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:37.910
Kuri kolme jalaga as teravad hambad
suus. No ei ole alati kuri.

42
00:02:38.010 --> 00:02:43.650
Ma tean, ma tean,
see on Marjul käiv Ivo,

43
00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:47.819
