101
00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:06.670
Mina ütlen ja siis.

102
00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.690
Ma teen need augud ise ära.

103
00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:12.150
Üks.

104
00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:14.220
Kaks,
see on nagu oleks kohe tuli takus,

105
00:06:14.320 --> 00:06:17.190
