Need grilltikud on nii paksud osad.

128
00:07:42.510 --> 00:07:46.110
Aga mismoodi on see
selle arvuti programmeerimis alus?

129
00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:49.220
Ma ei tea kuidagi niimoodi,
mina ei saa sellest arvutist väga

130
00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:53.310
