158
00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.630
Sest et ise peab mõtlema.

159
00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:32.480
Sellepärast kehva ta ongi esimese
arvuti nagu

160
00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:36.980
